Package: wanglinux-desktop
Version: 1.0.2-1~aurora3
Architecture: all
Maintainer: WangLinux Project <dev@wanglinux.example>
Installed-Size: 12
Depends: wanglinux-base (>= 1.0.0), wanglinux-theme (>= 1.0.0),
 task-xfce-desktop, xfce4-terminal, thunar, lightdm, lightdm-gtk-greeter,
 network-manager-gnome, firefox-esr | chromium, fonts-noto-cjk,
 fonts-noto-color-emoji, fcitx5, fcitx5-chinese-addons, locales, sudo, curl, git, htop, neofetch
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Description: WangLinux 1.0 desktop (meta package)
 One install pulls in the whole WangLinux desktop experience on top of a
 Debian 12 base: XFCE, browser, Chinese fonts and input method, network
 applet, and the WangLinux identity/theme packages.
 .
 This is the package that defines "a WangLinux release": bumping its version
 and updating its dependencies is how a new release is cut.
